    "naming_convention_prompt": "## Lab Naming Convention\n\nThis laboratory uses non-standard population names. You MUST use these exact names in your hierarchy:\n\n- **Blixtar Subset**: defined by `Time-gated events`\n- **Glorp Cells**: defined by `Dead Cells-`\n- **Grindlax Cells**: defined by `CD19+ CD20+`\n- **Nimbular Cells**: defined by `CD21+ CD27-`\n- **Splonix Subset**: defined by `CD21+ CD27+`\n- **Wumbus Cells**: defined by `CD21- CD27+`\n- **Vexilon Population**: defined by `CD21- CD27-`\n- **Plixnor Cells**: defined by `IgD- IgM-`\n- **Zymbrix Subset**: defined by `IgE+ IgG-`\n- **Morglian Cells**: defined by `IgA+ IgG-`\n- **Qwelnar Cells**: defined by `IgA1+`\n- **Snorfalax Population**: defined by `IgA2+`\n- **Grimblex Cells**: defined by `IgG+`\n- **Zorphan Population**: defined by `IgG1+`\n- **Threxix Population**: defined by `IgG2+`\n- **Krondule Cells**: defined by `IgG3+`\n- **Zanthrex Population**: defined by `IgG4+`\n- **Flurbigan Cells**: defined by `IgKappa+`\n- **Quixar Subset**: defined by `IgLambda+`\n\nUse standard names (Singlets, Lymphocytes, Live) for QC gates only.\n",
